  m_text: "A) \n1. Calculer f'(x) = 6x\xB2 - 6\r\n2. Calculer f'(1) = 6 - 6 = 0 (coefficient
    directeur)\r\n3. Calculer f(1) = 2 - 6 + 1 = -3 (ordonn\xE9e du point)\r\n4.
    \xC9quation : y = 0(x - 1) + (-3) = -3"
