    = 1 et X\u2082 = 2\r\n4. Revenir \xE0 x : e^x = 1 \u2192 x = 0 et e^x = 2 \u2192
    x = ln(2)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 90844b953a2b5a04ab905c2416a364c6, type: 2}
