  m_text: "A)\n1. Identifier les coefficients : a = 2, b = -1, c = 2, d = -6\r\n2.
    Appliquer la formule : d = |ax\u2080 + by\u2080 + cz\u2080 + d|/\u221A(a\xB2
    + b\xB2 + c\xB2)\r\n3. Calculer : d = |2(1) - 2 + 2(3) - 6|/\u221A(4 + 1 + 4)
    = |2|/3 = 2/3"
